
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lewis Kitchen | Fine Dining</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #111;
            color: white;
        }

        header {
            background: #171717;
            padding: 25px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 27px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 480px;
            background: linear-gradient(
                rgba(0,0,0,.55),
                rgba(0,0,0,.7)
            ), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?w=1600');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 52px;
            color: #d4af37;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: #d4af37;
            color: black;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        section {
            padding: 65px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        .menu {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .food {
            background: #222;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .food h3 {
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #171717;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">LEWIS KITCHEN</div>
    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#menu">Menu</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>Welcome to Lewis Kitchen</h1>
    <p>Exceptional Taste. Elegant Dining. Unforgettable Moments.</p>
    <a href="#menu" class="btn">Explore Our Menu</a>
</div>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>
        Welcome to Lewis Kitchen, where delicious food meets
        elegance. Enjoy a variety of carefully prepared meals
        in a warm and welcoming atmosphere.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="menu">
    <h2>Our Menu</h2>

    <div class="menu">
        <div class="food">
            <h3>Local Delights</h3>
            <p>Enjoy delicious traditional meals.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="food">
            <h3>Continental Meals</h3>
            <p>Experience international flavours.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="food">
            <h3>Grilled Specials</h3>
            <p>Freshly prepared grilled favourites.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="food">
            <h3>Drinks & Desserts</h3>
            <p>Refreshments and sweet treats.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Visit Lewis Kitchen</h2>
    <p>We look forward to serving you!</p>
    <p>Contact us to make an enquiry or reservation.</p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Lewis Kitchen. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
